@description AHS classroom migration: ReaPackLabSetup (replaces standard ReaPack; install only when instructed)
@author ReaLab
@version 0.1.1
@changelog
  One-time classroom deployment of the existing signed ReaPackLabSetup v0.1.1 release.
  Source binary is unchanged; this is a temporary additional repository entry.
@provides
  [darwin-arm64] reaper_reapacklabsetup-arm64.dylib https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabSetup/releases/download/v$version/$path
@link
  Official ReaPackLabSetup distribution https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLabSetup
  Managed ReaPackLab extension https://github.com/rockumk/ReaPackLab
@about
  # AHS classroom migration: ReaPackLabSetup

  **For classroom deployment only, when specifically instructed by the administrator.**

  Installing this extension starts a transition from standard ReaPack to a
  centrally managed ReaPackLab environment. ReaPackLabSetup downloads the
  ReaPackLab extension; ReaPackLab then retires original ReaPack extension
  binaries on macOS and preserves the old registry for migration.

  Only supports macOS 15.0 or newer on Apple Silicon (ARM64).
  The binary is Developer ID-signed, but the published v0.1.1 release
  has not been verified as notarized.

  Restart REAPER when instructed. Do not install on a personal machine
  unless you have agreed to this centrally managed configuration.

  Published temporarily in AHS_Music_Tech; the identical signed binary
  is hosted by the official ReaPackLabSetup release.
